1
00:00:00,077 --> 00:00:02,157
(Sheldon:)At least now
you can retrieve the black box...

2
00:00:02,329 --> 00:00:05,829
...from the smoldering wreckage
that was once your fantasy of dating her...

3
00:00:05,999 --> 00:00:09,839
...and analyze the data so that
you don't crash into geek mountain again.

4
00:00:11,171 --> 00:00:15,221
(Howard:)I disagree. Love is not a sprint.
It's a marathon.

5
00:00:15,384 --> 00:00:20,344
(Howard:)A relentless pursuit that only ends
when she falls into your arms...

6
00:00:20,514 --> 00:00:23,474
(Howard:)...or hits you with the pepper spray.

7
00:00:24,059 --> 00:00:25,349
No, I'm done with Penny.

8
00:00:25,936 --> 00:00:28,856
I'm gonna be more realistic
and go after someone my own speed.

9
00:00:29,022 --> 00:00:31,112
- Like who?
- I don't know.

10
00:00:31,275 --> 00:00:32,315
(Leonard:)Olivia Geiger?

11
00:00:32,484 --> 00:00:36,364
The dietitian at the cafeteria
with the limp and the lazy eye?

12
00:00:37,948 --> 00:00:40,408
(Leonard:)- Yeah.
- Well, I don't think you have a shot there.

13
00:00:41,910 --> 00:00:45,040
I have noticed that Leslie Winkle
recently started shaving her legs.

14
00:00:45,205 --> 00:00:48,295
(Sheldon:)Now, given that winter is coming,
one can assume she's signaling...

15
00:00:48,458 --> 00:00:49,668
(Sheldon:)...sexual availability.

16
00:00:50,544 --> 00:00:52,544
(Leonard:)I don't know.
You guys work in the same lab.

17
00:00:52,921 --> 00:00:55,051
- So?
- There are pitfalls.

18
00:00:55,215 --> 00:00:56,715
(Howard:)Trust me, I know.

19
00:00:56,883 --> 00:01:00,023
(Howard:)When it comes
to sexual-harassment law...

